---
const EMAIL = 'ramonfrv17@gmail.com';
---

<div class="reveal grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8 items-start">
	<div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6">
		<p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
			¿Tienes una oportunidad, un proyecto o simplemente quieres saludar? Escríbeme y te responderé lo antes posible.
		</p>
		<div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4">
			<a
				href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}
				class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-raised border border-surface-border hover:border-accent/40 hover:bg-accent/5 transition-all duration-300 group"
			>
				<span class="flex items-center justify-center size-10 sm:size-11 rounded-lg bg-accent/10 text-accent group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shrink-0">
					<svg class="size-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
					</svg>
				</span>
				<div class="min-w-0">
					<p class="text-xs text-muted uppercase tracking-wider">Email</p>
					<p class="text-primary font-medium text-sm sm:text-base truncate">{EMAIL}</p>
				</div>
			</a>
			<a
				href="tel:+526623046128"
				class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-raised border border-surface-border hover:border-accent/40 hover:bg-accent/5 transition-all duration-300 group"
			>
				<span class="flex items-center justify-center size-10 sm:size-11 rounded-lg bg-accent/10 text-accent group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shrink-0">
					<svg class="size-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
					</svg>
				</span>
				<div>
					<p class="text-xs text-muted uppercase tracking-wider">Teléfono</p>
					<p class="text-primary font-medium text-sm sm:text-base">+52 662 304 6128</p>
				</div>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>

	<form
		id="contact-form"
		class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-raised border border-surface-border shadow-lg shadow-black/5 dark:shadow-black/20 w-full"
	>
		<div class="mb-4">
			<label for="name" class="block text-sm font-medium mb-2 text-secondary">Nombre</label>
			<input
				type="text"
				id="name"
				name="name"
				required
				class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface border border-surface-border text-primary placeholder-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/50 focus:border-accent transition-all text-sm sm:text-base"
				placeholder="Tu nombre"
			/>
		</div>
		<div class="mb-4">
			<label for="email" class="block text-sm font-medium mb-2 text-secondary">Correo electrónico</label>
			<input
				type="email"
				id="email"
				name="email"
				required
				class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface border border-surface-border text-primary placeholder-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/50 focus:border-accent transition-all text-sm sm:text-base"
				placeholder="tu@email.com"
			/>
		</div>
		<div class="mb-6">
			<label for="message" class="block text-sm font-medium mb-2 text-secondary">Mensaje</label>
			<textarea
				id="message"
				name="message"
				rows="4"
				required
				class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface border border-surface-border text-primary placeholder-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/50 focus:border-accent transition-all resize-none text-sm sm:text-base"
				placeholder="Cuéntame sobre tu proyecto u oportunidad..."
			></textarea>
		</div>
		<button
			type="submit"
			class="w-full py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-white bg-accent hover:bg-accent-dark rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-accent/25 active:translate-y-0 text-sm sm:text-base"
		>
			Enviar mensaje
		</button>
	</form>
</div>

<script define:vars={{ EMAIL }}>
	document.getElementById('contact-form')?.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
		event.preventDefault();
		const form = event.target;
		const name = form.elements.namedItem('name').value;
		const email = form.elements.namedItem('email').value;
		const message = form.elements.namedItem('message').value;
		const subject = encodeURIComponent(`Contacto desde portafolio — ${name}`);
		const body = encodeURIComponent(`Nombre: ${name}\nEmail: ${email}\n\nMensaje:\n${message}`);
		window.location.href = `mailto:${EMAIL}?subject=${subject}&body=${body}`;
	});
</script>
